{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 10 · WORKSHOP — the bench where work happens",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -1250,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WORKSHOP\n**24 tracked tasks · 1 real blocker**\n[[10 - Workshop/Workshop]] · [[TODO]] · [[Milestones]]\n[[10 - Workshop/AI Project Handoff]]",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -1090,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🔴 BLOCKED — R307S fingerprint sensor · **UNVERIFIED**\n**Assembled** per owner report: red→`VIN`, black→`GND`, yellow→`GPIO32` (sensor TX), green→`GPIO33` (sensor RX); blue/white open.\n**Result:** 0 bytes at all 12 documented baud rates, normal *and* software-swapped routing. 0 unsolicited transitions in 1.5 s.\n**Line state:** GPIO32 reads as actively **driven high** under both internal pull-down and pull-up — consistent with a live TXD, but *not* a calibrated voltage and *not* proof of supply.\n**Blocked on:** a multimeter. `ReadSysPara` and `TemplateCount` were gated on any valid ACK, so they were **never executed**.\n**Leading unmeasured suspect:** the 3.3 V solder jumper. 5 V into a shorted jumper kills the module silently.",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -870,
      "width": 2300,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "g004",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "UNBLOCK CHAIN",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -510,
      "width": 2300,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**HW-00**\nmeasure rail, TX level, ground continuity, jumper",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**HW-01**\nuart1/uart2 loopback with the sensor detached",
      "x": -665,
      "y": -430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**HW-10**\nUSB pad path — only once pad order is identified",
      "x": -210,
      "y": -430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**HW-05/06**\nReadSysPara / TemplateCount once any ACK arrives",
      "x": 245,
      "y": -430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**provision**\nresolve sensor capacity → then, only then, the backend device",
      "x": 700,
      "y": -430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g010",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "DONE — closed by evidence",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 568,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**SQLite schema v1, migrations, constraints**\n6 temporary-DB tests",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Backend vertical slice**\n10/10 pytest green",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": -32,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Firmware test infrastructure**\n27 environments compile and link",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Production runtime**\nBUILD PASS — RAM 13.3% Flash 66.0%",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 124,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**R307S read-only diagnostic**\nbounded, no destructive command",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 202,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Beginner / software / fair documentation**\nwritten, honestly hedged",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g017",
