      "x": 380,
      "y": 436,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Queue replay**\nNEEDS INTEGRATION TEST",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 514,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Full attendance flow**\nNEEDS HARDWARE",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 592,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g034",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "NEXT — in this order",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 568,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t035",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**1 · Identify the module**\nphotograph markings, connector, jumper",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**2 · Measure**\nground, VIN rail, TX idle high — record before changing anything",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": -32,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**3 · Isolate the UART**\nloopback GPIO25→GPIO26, sensor detached",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t038",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**4 · Prove the cheap parts**\ni2c_scan, oled, rtc, green_led, red_led, buzzer",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 124,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t039",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**5 · Then network**\nstorage, wifi_diag, backend_http, isolated synthetic only",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 202,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**6 · Then production**\nenrollment → POST → outage → reboot → replay, exactly once",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 72,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t041",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stop writing code\nThe implementation is complete enough to be tested and not complete enough to be **trusted**. The gap is evidence, not functionality. More feature code now raises the cost of every future physical session and proves nothing.",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 2300,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
